────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── council ─
❯ /
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Session
  /clear                        Start a fresh conversation with the main agent…
  /resume                       Pick an earlier conversation or a run to carry…
  /artifacts                    The pages this conversation published: open on…
  /exit                         Close the screen. Runs keep going
  /compact                      Summarize the conversation to free context
  /rename                       Rename the conversation
  /branch                       Start a new conversation from here and keep th…
  /fork                         Copy the conversation into a new background se…
  /btw                          Ask a side question that stays out of the conv…
  /recap                        One line on where the conversation stands
  /copy                         Copy the last answer, or the nth from last
  /export                       Save the conversation as plain text
